OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFirms told to publish salaries in job
OL,4,Aadverts ahead of new law
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt argues the change will help
OL,7,Fjobseekers, particularly those applying
OL,8,Ffor their first job, and could help
OL,9,Fprevent pay discrimination. However,
OL,10,Fone industry group said setting pay was
OL,11,Fa complex process and regulating
OL,12,Fadverts was not always suitable.
OL,14,FIt comes a week after the UK's equality
OL,15,Fwatchdog said employees should legally
OL,16,Fbe able to find out what their
OL,17,Fcolleagues are earning.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
