OL,3,APope begins lengthy trip to Latin
OL,4,AAmerica weeks after lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV is beginning a lengthy
OL,7,Ftrip to Latin America just three weeks
OL,8,Fafter surgery for lung cancer - a tour
OL,9,Fthat includes a much-anticipated
OL,10,F"homecoming" to Peru where he was a
OL,11,Fpriest for many years.
OL,13,FThe Vatican says no extraordinary
OL,14,Fmeasures are being taken in relation to
OL,15,Fthe Pope's health, describing him as a
OL,16,F"71-year-old who has undergone an
OL,17,Foperation" not someone with a
OL,18,F"permanent medical condition".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1793949479
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APope begins lengthy trip to Latin
OL,4,AAmerica weeks after lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was Leo himself who revealed last
OL,7,Fmonth that doctors had discovered a
OL,8,Ftumour during a routine scan. The
OL,9,Fgrowth was removed along with the lower
OL,10,Flobe of his right lung and his medical
OL,11,Fteam then confirmed the cancer had not
OL,12,Fspread.
OL,14,FAt a briefing in Rome ahead of the
OL,15,Ftrip, which takes in Uruguay and
OL,16,FArgentina as well as Peru, a
OL,17,Fspokeswoman stressed that Pope Leo had
OL,18,F"fantastic stamina" and was "extremely
OL,19,Fenthusiastic" about the schedule which
OL,20,Fhe had "personally confirmed... with no
OL,21,Fchanges".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
