OL,3,ATrump signs order preventing future
OL,4,Apresidents from changing Oval Office
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has signed an
OL,7,Fexecutive order that he says will
OL,8,Fprevent future presidents from making
OL,9,Fcertain changes to the White House Oval
OL,10,FOffice.
OL,12,FTrump, a former real estate mogul, has
OL,13,Fdrastically altered the look of the
OL,14,Fpresident's official office during his
OL,15,Fsecond term, most notably with adding
OL,16,Fmany gold features.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
