OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump signs order preventing future
OL,4,Apresidents from changing Oval Office
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're making it a national monument,
OL,7,Fand it will not be allowed to be
OL,8,Ftouched by anybody, destroyed, ripped
OL,9,Fdown by stupid people, in order to
OL,10,Fbuild something in a slightly different
OL,11,Fshape," Trump told reporters on
OL,12,FThursday.
OL,14,FThe order comes months after Trump tore
OL,15,Fdown the entirety of the White House
OL,16,FEast Wing in a project that has faced
OL,17,Flegal challenges.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
